              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma nubwo yagenzire Nobbu, hali Ahimereki nyakatagara; Ahimereki yaija kumutangirra naatukumira, yamukaguza ati: “Kiki ekikuleesire wenka otaina muntu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yamugarukamu ati: “Omukama aina ekiyantumire; ‘kandi akanteererra ekintu eki, ekiyantumire kandi ekiyandagiire kutakigambiraho muntu noomu.’ Abasigazi bange, ndagaine nabo nti: Turaasaangaana omukiikaro bunanka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yamukaguza ati: Oina ki? Mpa emigaati etaano, rundi ekintu ekindi kyona ekyoinakyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyakatagara yagarukamu Daudi ati: “Tinyina mugaati ogwa butoosa, nyina omugaati ogurukwera; abasaija bawe obubaraaba bamazire ebiro ebihingwire batarukweyiriza haihi bakazi, nugwo nkuhe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yagarukamu nyakatagara ati: “Obumba ningenda orugendo, tufuuhiza kimu abakazi; noobu tuba nitugenda orugendo orwa butoosa, ebikwato eby'abasigazi biikara nibyera, kandi kaaswa hati, tibayere kukiraho muno?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.24.5+LEV.24.6+LEV.24.7+LEV.24.8+LEV.24.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 24:5-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyakatagara nukwo kuha Daudi omugaati ogurukwera; habwokuba omugaati ogwakaba ainagwo, nugwo ogu ogukaba guhongiirwe MUKAMA, ogwaihirwe ha meeza erukwera, omukiikaro kyagwo haagarurwamu ogundi ogwakaruga kucumbwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
